1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,437
Meet the Coyote.

2
00:00:01,757 --> 00:00:04,360
He's a troublemaker, and he gets in the way.

3
00:00:05,366 --> 00:00:08,076
Here he is, waiting at the side of the table.

4
00:00:09,199 --> 00:00:12,271
You can put the Coyote on one of your opponent's animals.

5
00:00:12,591 --> 00:00:14,639
Your opponent is the other player.

6
00:00:15,766 --> 00:00:19,009
Way one: the card Add Three Stones and Move Coyote.

7
00:00:19,329 --> 00:00:20,460
Ana picks it.

8
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:24,892
She draws three stones into the bowl.

9
00:00:25,212 --> 00:00:27,239
This card doesn't let her take one.

10
00:00:29,316 --> 00:00:31,919
Then she moves the Coyote onto Ben's Turtle.

11
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,868
Now Ben's Turtle is blocked.

12
00:00:35,188 --> 00:00:37,726
Blocked means Ben can't add any stones to it.

13
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:40,561
The stones already there stay.

14
00:00:40,881 --> 00:00:42,502
They still count for points.

15
00:00:43,633 --> 00:00:47,323
Way two is a secret on the back of the Take One Stone cards.

16
00:00:47,643 --> 00:00:49,009
Look at Ben's cards.

17
00:00:50,549 --> 00:00:54,219
Ben plays one Take One Stone card, and turns it face-down.

18
00:00:54,539 --> 00:00:56,437
On its back is half a Coyote!

19
00:00:57,983 --> 00:01:00,372
On a later turn, he plays the other one.

20
00:01:00,692 --> 00:01:02,079
Both are face-down.

21
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:04,404
The two halves make a whole Coyote!

22
00:01:06,483 --> 00:01:08,232
So Ben may move the Coyote.

23
00:01:08,552 --> 00:01:10,280
He puts it on Ana's Rabbit.

24
00:01:11,399 --> 00:01:14,087
The Coyote is only ever on one animal.

25
00:01:14,407 --> 00:01:16,050
Ben's Turtle is free again.

26
00:01:17,166 --> 00:01:18,062
Remember.

27
00:01:18,382 --> 00:01:21,625
The Coyote blocks one animal: no new stones there.

28
00:01:21,945 --> 00:01:24,889
Move him with Add Three Stones and Move Coyote.

29
00:01:25,209 --> 00:01:28,942
Or move him when both your Take One Stone cards are face-down.

30
00:01:29,262 --> 00:01:32,313
Next: Spirit Stones, and how the game ends.
